[00:47.52]1. “Listen to my prayer,” Jehovah.
[00:56.92]Let yourself be found by me.
[01:06.92]Feel the anguish deep inside me;
[01:12.92]Help me unafraid to be.
[01:17.69](Chorus)
[01:22.46]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[01:28.46]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[01:36.76]He will always give protection.
[01:42.60]He is loyal; he is true.
[01:51.74]2. Had I wings just as a dove has,
[01:57.50]Far from danger I would fly,
[02:03.34]Safe from those who seek to hurt me,
[02:09.58]Sheltered from their hateful cry.
[02:20.44](Chorus)
[02:24.44]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[02:28.44]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[02:33.88]He will always give protection.
[02:39.76]He is loyal; he is true.
[02:58.36]3. Comfort from our God, Jehovah,
[03:02.86]Always brings us peace of mind.
[03:11.86]He will help us bear our burden.
[03:17.86]He is loving; he is kind.
[03:26.78](Chorus)
[03:30.65]Throw your burden on Jehovah;
[03:34.51]Trust in him to sustain and save you.
[03:40.03]He will always give protection.
[03:45.53]He is loyal; he is true.